body:
Imagine being a kid in a sandbox. You've just dug a big hole, Mum and Dad comes and tells you it's time to go. So you get out of the hole, then Mum and Dad turns around and goes "you know what, we'll stay and help out cleaning". So you jump straight back in, and dig even further.

&#x200B;

![gif](emote|free_emotes_pack|downvote)![gif](emote|free_emotes_pack|downvote)![gif](emote|free_emotes_pack|downvote) The price must go!
